{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00591","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第二章 · 蔡孚","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第二章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝宅王家大道边，神马龙龟涌圣泉。\n昔日昔时经此地，看来看去渐成川。\n歌台舞榭宜正月，柳岸梅洲胜往年。\n莫言波上春云少，祗爲从龙直上天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}